#. Translators: station is the "Mix Radio" for the user %s.
#. * See http://blog.last.fm/2010/10/29/mix-radio-a-new-radio-station for description.
#: plugins/audioscrobbler/rb-audioscrobbler-radio-source.c:137
#, c-format
